# Direct provider credentials for the developer-only eval subsystem.
#
# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in exactly one provider credential.
# The credential never selects a provider or model: `--provider` and `--model` are
# always explicit and there is no fallback.
#
# Use a dedicated, low-limit, revocable key. A skill under evaluation shares the
# guest credential boundary with the harness.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
